    <title>清欢渡 - Gemini's Dreamscape</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #faf8f5;
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.8;
